<title>BARBADOS: CRICKET-BARBADOS V INDIA SCOREBOARD.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-BARBADOS V INDIA SCOREBOARD.</headline>
<dateline>BRIDGETOWN, Barbados 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scoreboard at</p>
<p>close of the final day of the three day match between Barbados</p>
<p>and India at the Kennington Oval on Monday.</p>
<p>India first innings: 210 all out</p>
<p>Barbados first innings: 338 for 4 declared</p>
<p>India second innings</p>
