<p> S.Ganguly not out		 73</p>
<p> R.Dravid c Browne b Bryan	3</p>
<p> N.Sidhu c Browne b Thompson    6</p>
<p> S.Karim not out		    9</p>
<p> Extras				13</p>
<p> Total (for five wickets)     166</p>
<p>Fall of wickets: 1-61 2-61 3-67 4-102 5-121</p>
